    transform: rotate(-90deg);
}
</code></pre> Adding a custom font <p>Adding a custom font. You have to host the font on your own server. A font hosted inside your Shopify store counts as private, or sits behind a restriction, so the quiz cannot load it. Host it elsewhere, or use a Google Font as Advanced customizations (CSS) shows.</p> <pre><code>@font-face {
