{# DYNAMIC RESULT PAGE CONTENT (LOOPS THROUGH RESULT_SECTIONS-lBJ9bk) #}
{# This template loops through the result sections and blocks          #}
{# It will adapt if you change the results page structure in the quiz editor #}
{# ================================================================= #}
