  function prqQuizCallback(quizResponse){
    console.log(quizResponse);
  }
&lt;/script&gt;
</code></pre> <p>This logs the whole response JSON to the console. It is a starting point: replace the body with whatever your integration needs.</p> </li> <li> <p>Store the response before anything else happens. Wrap any redirect inside the callback, so the data is saved first.</p> <pre><code>function prqQuizCallback(quizResponse) {
