  // Then, redirect the user to the desired page:
  window.location.href = 'yourTargetURLHere';
}
</code></pre> <p>Cookies, local storage or query parameters all work. Pick whichever suits the data.</p> </li> <li> <p>Let the customer reach the results page. The callback only fires there. Even a fraction of a second is enough. A redirect that skips the results page skips the callback too.</p> </li> <li> <p>Add the other callbacks you need. Each one is a global function the quiz calls when its event happens.</p> <pre><code>function prqAddOneToCartCallback(event) {
