ShopifyShopify (Legacy)WooCommerceMagentoBigCommerceStandalone <p>Animation classes</p> <p>The app adds one of these to a slide while it moves. <code>forward</code> runs when the customer advances, <code>backward</code> when they go back. <code>enter</code> is on the slide coming in, <code>exit</code> on the one leaving.</p> Selector Description <code>.horizontal-forward.enter</code> Horizontal forward enter animation <code>.horizontal-forward.exit</code> Horizontal forward exit animation <code>.horizontal-backward.enter</code> Horizontal backward enter animation <code>.horizontal-backward.exit</code> Horizontal backward exit animation <code>.vertical-forward.enter</code> Vertical forward enter animation <code>.vertical-forward.exit</code> Vertical forward exit animation <code>.vertical-backward.enter</code> Vertical backward enter animation <code>.vertical-backward.exit</code> Vertical backward exit animation <p>Examples</p> <pre><code>/* Custom transition timing */
.question-navigation-item {
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
}

/* Disable animations */
.quiz * {
    transition: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
}
</code></pre> <p>Animation classes are a Built for Shopify feature</p> <p>These enter and exit classes belong to the Built for Shopify version.</p> <p>Animation classes are a Built for Shopify feature</p> <p>These enter and exit classes belong to the Built for Shopify version.</p> <p>Animation classes are a Built for Shopify feature</p> <p>These enter and exit classes belong to the Built for Shopify version.</p> <p>Animation classes are a Built for Shopify feature</p> <p>These enter and exit classes belong to the Built for Shopify version.</p> <p>Animation classes are a Built for Shopify feature</p> <p>These enter and exit classes belong to the Built for Shopify version.</p>

